rn back [from fighting in Allāh's cause] and [thus] become losers.\"","j":6,"h":11,"s":5,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"5:22","t":"They said, \"O Moses, indeed within it is a people of tyrannical strength, and indeed, we will never enter it until they leave it; but if they leave it, then we will enter.\"","j":6,"h":11,"s":5,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"5:23","t":"Said two men from those who feared [to disobey] upon whom Allāh had bestowed favor, \"Enter upon them through the gate, for when you have entered it, you will be predominant. And upon Allāh rely, if you should be believers.\"","j":6,"h":11,"s":5,"a":23,"sd":null}],"juz":6,"hizb":11,"surahs":[5],"sajdah":false}